<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;After the initial offering period, Units will be available as of the end of each month at the
then current net asset value per Unit which will be stated both in ounces of gold, reflecting the
U.S. dollar price per ounce of gold established at the London A.M fixing on the last business day
of the month, and in dollars. For example, assume the initial net asset value per Unit was $900,
or one ounce of gold, as described above. Further assume that at the end of the first month
