</DIV>

<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 12pt"><B>The Failure of a Clearing Broker or Currency Dealer Could Result in Losses</B>
</DIV>


<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The Commodity Exchange Act requires a clearing broker to segregate all funds received from
customers from such broker&#146;s proprietary assets. If any of the clearing brokers fails to do so, the
assets of the Fund might not be fully protected in the event of the bankruptcy of the clearing
broker. Furthermore, in the event of any of the clearing broker&#146;s bankruptcy, the Fund would be
limited to recovering only a pro rata share of all available funds segregated on behalf of the
clearing broker&#146;s combined customer accounts. The Fund&#146;s trading in currency forward contracts
will generally be conducted in the dealer market, which is dominated by major money center banks,
not subject to the provision of the Commodity Exchange Act. As a result, you do not have the
protections provided by the Commodity Exchange Act in the event of the bankruptcy of a Fund
currency dealer.
</DIV>
<DIV align="left">
<A name="125"></A>
</DIV>

<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 12pt"><B>The Fund is Subject to Conflicts of Interest</B>
</DIV>


<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The Fund is subject to numerous conflicts of interest. The General Partner acts as both
trading advisor and general partner of the Fund and each Series. The fees payable to the General
Partner were established by it and were not the subject of arm&#146;s-length negotiation. Superfund
Asset Management, Inc. and the General Partner both have financial incentives to promote the sale
and discourage the redemption of Units. The General Partner has not established any formal
procedures for resolving conflicts of interest and you will be dependent on the good faith of the
parties with conflicts to resolve the conflicts equitably. See &#147;Conflicts of Interest.&#148;
</DIV>
<DIV align="left">
<A name="126"></A>
</DIV>

<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 12pt"><B>No Independent Experts Represented Investors in the Formation of the Fund</B>
</DIV>


<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The General Partner has consulted with counsel, accountants and other experts regarding the
formation and operation of the Fund. No counsel has been appointed to represent the Limited
