<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The Fund is not an investment company subject to the Investment Company Act of 1940.
Accordingly, you do not have the protections afforded by that statute which, for example, requires
