</DIV>


<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A Limited Partner may request any or all of his Units, at the net asset value per Unit of the
redemption of the relevant Series, as of the end of the month, subject to a minimum redemption of
