<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Futures and related contracts can be traded in many countries, which makes it possible to
diversify risk around the globe. This diversification is available both geographically and across
market sectors. For example, an investor
